    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desolation Seed</strong> survive in a virtual wasteland of global demise and environmental decay using\u00a0 remote EEG powered UAV mechanics ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818470/extras/f82323cf536d547f8eaab84a4a17be1f.poster.avif?t=1744672263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818470/extras/f82323cf536d547f8eaab84a4a17be1f.webm?t=1744672263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818470/extras/f82323cf536d547f8eaab84a4a17be1f.mp4?t=1744672263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ab  no storyline - no direction just exist and explore in a complete open world of disease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0and desolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ab Engage in environmental problem solving to progress through the diseased earth while  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 searching for sustenance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25ab Communicate with the remnants of humanity while exploring endless labyrinths  <br>of societal ruin and be fully immersed in virtual desolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25abHumanity is a source of food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818470/extras/e701df8889872edddf8fb72440057db3.poster.avif?t=1744672263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818470/e